{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Segoe UI;}}\f0\fs24\b Magic Trackpad for Windows\b0\par
Setup installs the trackpad driver, settings panel, and battery indicator. When setup finishes, plug in your trackpad or pair it in Windows Bluetooth settings.\par
\par Open Magic Trackpad from Start to adjust how clicks feel. Hover over the battery beside the clock to check its charge.\par
\par This community app includes MIT-licensed tools and a GPLv2 driver and settings panel. Find licenses and source under ThirdParty in the installation folder.\par}
